Third-party material in Vitrail Bridge
======================================

Vitrail Bridge is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 only, in LICENSE
(with the GNU General Public License version 3 it refers to, in COPYING).

It contains no code of the mods it works with, and ships none of them. It finds them at run time and reaches into
them with mixins, by the names of their classes and members.

Opal Shaders 1.0.0-alpha.8
Its metadata gives the license as "UNDECIDED". Not redistributed; nothing of it is copied. src/stubs names the few
members this mod calls, so that it compiles without the jar, and is left out of the built jar.

Vectors 1.5.3
Copyright 2026 Vector contributors
MIT License. Not redistributed. src/stubs names the members this mod calls and is left out of the built jar. The
ranges of the sliders in gui/VectorsPages.java are the ones its own settings screen gives them.

VulkanMod Reforged, https://github.com/TrulyRin/VulkanMod-Reforged
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
Not redistributed; a run-time dependency when present. gui/ uses its public settings registry.

Flywheel, https://github.com/Engine-Room/Flywheel
MIT License
Not redistributed. mixin/FlywheelShaderPackMixin.java answers its question whether a shader pack is in use.
